Subject: [PATCH 240/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Report skipped terrain bake
 operations.

Trace bake entry, restoration, probing and every supported early-out reason.
Read back the cells changed most by a bake and warn when the terrain accepted
none of the requested height changes.
